{"Title":"An Act relative to retiree work hours and pay limits","BillNumber":"H4069","DocketNumber":"HD4416","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MTL1","Name":"Marc T. Lombardo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MTL1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-26T09:49:49.337"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MTL1","Name":"Marc T. Lombardo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MTL1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-26T09:49:49.3366667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4069/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Lombardo of Billerica, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Marc T. Lombardo relative to retiree work hours and pay limits.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 91 of chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 96 and 111, the figure “1,200”, each time that it appears and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following figure:- 2,000.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 91 of said chapter 32, as so appearing, is hereby further amended by striking out, in line 100, the figure “$15,000” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- $30,000.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}